h Bartesian, you don’t have to worry about finding and perfecting a lemon drop martini recipe. Forgo the cocktail shaker and ingredients, sit back, and relax while our cocktail maker does the work for you. Simply pop a lemon drop martini capsule into your cocktail maker, select your desired strength and press Mix!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBase spirit: Vodka\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eThe Perfect Balance of Vodka and Lemon Juice\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lemon drop martini is a bright, zingy cocktail that brings the party anywhere it goes. For a festive, fun cocktail, the lemon martini hits it out of the park. Smooth vodka blends nicely with the lemon juice to create a crisp, clean flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTraditionally served in a chilled martini glass with a lemon wedge, you’ll love sipping on this sophisticated cocktail with friends and family after a long day at the office.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eShop Lemon Drop Capsules at Bartesian Today\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReady for a refreshing cocktail? Bartesian is here to serve! In 30 seconds, you’ll be indulging in the sweet and sour flavor profile of vodka and a lemon twist. From hosting parties to serving a fancy drink at dinner, Bartesian is here to make your cocktails taste incredible every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cbutton id=\"myBtn\" onclick=\"myFunction()\"\u003eRead More\u003c\/button\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2020-05-24T10:30:00-05:00","created_at":"2020-02-29T01:54:29-06:00","updated_at":"2026-10-19T11:11:01-05:00","vendor":"Bartesian","product_type":"Cocktails","tags":["832cap","base-spirit_vodka","best seller","bundle-filter__popular","bundle-filter__vodka","Cocktails","garnish-icon-citrus-wedge","glassware-icon-martini-glass","Highest Rated","klaviyoeligible","optimonkineligible","promo","QuizLow","QuizSour","QuizSweet","QuizUpper","vodka"],"variants":[{"id":31660702203953,"title":"6 Capsules","option1":"6 Capsules","option2":nul