ol.\u003cspan id=\"dots\"\u003e...\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv id=\"more\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eBartesian’s cocktail capsules are convenient and easy to use, so cocktail enthusiasts and amateurs alike can create their own Jungle Bird at the touch of a button. With a Jungle Bird in hand, sit back, relax, and enjoy a taste of the jungle with one of the best tiki-inspired cocktails.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n  \u003ch2\u003eMake a Delicious Tropical Rum Cocktail at Home\u003c\/h2\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eReady to be living on island time? Choose your favorite rum, pop your Jungle Bird capsule in our cocktail maker, choose your designed strength, and press “Mix.” After 30 seconds, your cocktail should be ready!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eServe in a bird glass or lowball, then garnish with a pineapple wedge or leaves. Take your cocktail to the next level with premium \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/bartesian.com\/collections\/ice-makers\"\u003eBartesian clear ice\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n  \u003ch2\u003eShop Jungle Bird Cocktail Capsules at Bartesian\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eFrom happy hours at home to dinner parties with friends, Bartesian cocktail capsules are the perfect way to provide a premium cocktail experience for guests. Bring the bar to your home with our Jungle Bird capsules. Order now!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003cbutton onclick=\"myFunction()\" id=\"myBtn\"\u003eRead More\u003c\/button\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2022-05-03T11:41:35-05:00","created_at":"2022-04-27T18:10:50-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-19T11:11:01-05:00","vendor":"Bartesian","product_type":"Cocktails","tags":["832cap","base-spirit_rum","bundle-filter__rum","Cocktails","garnish-icon-pineapple","glassware-icon-low-ball","klaviyoeligible","optimonkineligible","promo","QuizBitter","QuizLow","QuizLower","QuizMock","QuizSweet","QuizTropical","rum","upsell_recharge"],"variants":[{"id":42144683983047,"title":"8 Capsules","option1":"8 Capsules",